<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary credits.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary credits.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico has completed all five credit auctions in the secondary market.</p>
<p>The credits were assigned as follows</p>
<p>AMOUNT     TERM     MAXIMUM   MINIMUM   AVERAGE  BIDS  BIDDERS</p>
<p>1.456 bln  11 days  32.50     32.26     32.38     9     4</p>
<p>1.455 bln   7 days  32.30     32.11     32.20     8     4</p>
<p>1.455 bln   5 days  32.17     31.85     32.03    10     5</p>
<p>1.455 bln   4 days  31.71     31.66     31.67     4     4</p>
<p>1.000 bln   3 days  31.57     31.31     31.57     2     2</p>
<p>NOTE: The maximum, minimum and average are percentages.</p>
<p>- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9500</p>
</text>
